    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "On October 11, 2025, crowds "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "cheered",
            "ref": "v-cheer"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " as 80-year-old Natalie Grabow crossed the finish line in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Hawaii",
            "zh": "夏威夷"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She had just finished the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Ironman World Championship",
            "zh": "铁人三项世界锦标赛"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Many younger athletes "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "gave up halfway",
            "ref": "v-give-up-halfway"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But Ms. Grabow kept going for 16 hours and 45 minutes. She had made history as the oldest woman to finish the race."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The Ironman is one of the hardest races in the world. It has three parts: a 2.4-mile swim, a 112-mile bike ride, and a 26.2-mile run. It "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tests",
            "ref": "v-test"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " both the body and mind. Most people can’t "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "imagine",
            "ref": "v-imagine"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " finishing it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Ms. Grabow has been "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "active",
            "ref": "v-active"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " all her life. She played tennis when her kids were young. Later, she started running. But she didn’t know how to swim until she was 59 years old. She took lessons so she could join her friends in Ironman races. Since then, she has finished 11 Ironman races. “It’s important to find something you enjoy,” she said. “It keeps you excited every day.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Now, Ms. Grabow is planning her next "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "challenge",
            "ref": "v-challenge"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". She will "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sign up",
            "ref": "v-sign-up"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for two more Ironman races next year. For her, age is just a number."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
